     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. At least 200 women from the Gagauzia region and neighboring regions have access to quality services and support from trained specialists;
2. 10 local MDTs for the prevention of domestic violence created in at least 10 localities
3. Approx. 50 local leaders are trained and have increased capacity in the field of national standards on combating gender-based violence, in order to develop and implement a local action plan;
4. Opinion leaders and decision-makers are made aware of violence against women and girls - at least 2,000 people will be involved in information campaigns;
5. At least 70 women and men helped to get employment;
6. At least 5 supported enterprises / businesses;
